menu.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 23" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">23</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Gilmore</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Death Pass (entrada de Dragon Valley)</span></span></label><p>Fale com o <span class="npc-name">Gilmore</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.<br/>Escolha a última das três opções.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 24" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">24</span><span><strong><span class="boss-name">Baraham (medusa)</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Bee Hive, dentro da caverna (após Dion)</span></span></label><p>Vá a Dion, depois a Bee Hive, entre na caverna e mate a medusa <span class="boss-name">Baraham</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span> para receber <span class="quest-item">Legend of Seventeen</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 25" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">25</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Kantabilon</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Heine, Grocery Store</span></span></label><p>Volte ao <span class="npc-name">Talien</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> em Aden e depois vá à Heine.<br/>O <span class="npc-name">Kantabilon</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> pede 10 <span class="quest-item">Malruk Succubus Claw</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Escolha a opção inferior.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 26" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">26</span><span><strong><span class="boss-name">Malruk Succubus</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Dragon Valley</span></span></label><p>Mate <span class="boss-name">Malruk Succubus</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span> ou <span class="boss-name">Malruk Succubus Turen</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span> até obter 10 <span class="quest-item">Malruk Succubus Claw</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>O drop é lento.<br/>Entregue ao Kantabilon e receba <span class="quest-item">Echo Crystal – Forgotten Song</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 27" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">27</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Stedmiel</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, <span class="npc-name">Virgil</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, <span class="npc-name">Ogmar</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, <span class="npc-name">Rahorakti</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Aden → Hunters Village → Rune</span></span></label><p>Siga a cadeia: <span class="npc-name">Talien</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (Aden)<br/>→ <span class="npc-name">Stedmiel</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (Warrior Guild, Hunters Village)<br/>→ <span class="npc-name">Talien</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (Aden)<br/>→ <span class="npc-name">Virgil</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (Templo, Rune)<br/>→ <span class="npc-name">Ogmar</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (ao lado do Virgil, Rune)<br/>→ <span class="npc-name">Rahorakti</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (Mystic Guild, Rune).<br/>O Rahorakti pede 5 <span class="quest-item">Crimson Moss</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 28" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">28</span><span><strong><span class="boss-name">Splinter Stakato Drones</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Swamp of Screams</span></span></label><p>Teleporte até Swamp of Screams e mate <span class="boss-name">Splinter Stakato Drones</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span> (também Walkers e Soldiers) até obter 5 <span class="quest-item">Crimson Moss</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Volte ao Rahorakti e receba <span class="quest-item">Mirakulous Medicine</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 29" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">29</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Kassandra</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Town of Rune, ao lado do Virgil</span></span></label><p>Entregue o <span class="quest-item">Mirakulous Medicine</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> à <span class="npc-name">Kassandra</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.<br/>Depois volte ao <span class="npc-name">Virgil</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, que manda para o Caradine em Goddard.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 30" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">30</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> e <span class="npc-name">Noel</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Town of Goddard, Magic Shop perto da saída; Noel no ferreiro</span></span></label><p>Fale com a <span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (em frente à Magic Shop).<br/>Ela manda ao <span class="npc-name">Noel</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, o ferreiro de Goddard, que pede <span class="quest-item">Hellfire Oil</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> e 5 <span class="quest-item">Lunargents</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Entregue com a subclasse ativa.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 31" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">31</span><span><strong>Preparar Hellfire Oil e 5 Lunargents</strong><span class="place">Localização: Ivory Tower, caldeirão perto do Wesley</span></span></label><p>Crie os itens no caldeirão da Ivory Tower, perto do <span class="npc-name">Wesley</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.<br/>Os <span class="quest-item">Lunargents</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> vêm da quest Supplier of Reagents (etapa 14).<br/>A lista de materiais está na aba Inventário.<br/><span class="eternal-tip"><b>Atalho Eternal x10:</b> a <span class="npc-name">Maria</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> troca 500 <span class="quest-item">Moonstone Shard</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> por 5 <span class="quest-item">Lunargents</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Para o <span class="quest-item">Hellfire Oil</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>, use 100 <span class="quest-item">Lava Stone</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>100 <span class="quest-item">Demon Blood</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> (drop do <span class="boss-name">Bloody Guardian</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span>, TOI 5).</span></p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 32" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">32</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> → <span class="npc-name">Virgil</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong></span></label><p>Volte ao <span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> e escolha a opção superior do menu para receber <span class="quest-item">Virgil&#39;s Letter</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Leve ao <span class="npc-name">Virgil</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, que diz que a <span class="npc-name">Kassandra</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> precisa de ajuda.<br/>Fim da Parte 1.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 33" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">33</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Kassandra</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, <span class="npc-name">Ogmar</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> e Mysterious Dark Knight</strong><span class="place">Localização: Devil's Pass</span></span></label><p>Fale com a <span class="npc-name">Kassandra</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, depois com o <span class="npc-name">Ogmar</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, depois com o Mysterious Dark Knight em Devil&#39;s Pass.<br/>Fale com os anjos mortos ao redor; cada um some, exceto o último.<br/>Volte ao Knight, que manda à <span class="npc-name">Witch Kalis</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.</p><p class="prereq">Parte 2 · requisito: subclasse nível 60 e Parte 1 concluída.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 34" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">34</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Witch Kalis</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> e <span class="npc-name">Matild</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Kalis entre Ivory Tower e Tower of Insolence; Matild entre Seal of Spores e Ivory Tower</span></span></label><p>A Kalis manda à <span class="npc-name">Matild</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, que entrega <span class="quest-item">Sorcery Ingredient</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Volte à Kalis, que recebe o item e manda ao Valley of Saints.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 35" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">35</span><span><strong><span class="boss-name">Quest Monsters Restrainer of Glory</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Valley of Saints, caverna</span></span></label><p>Na caverna com um unicórnio morto entre quatro pilares, mate os monstros de quest até obter 4 <span class="quest-item">Orb of Binding</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Coloque um orb em cada pilar, reviva o unicórnio e use um <span class="quest-item">Scroll of Escape</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> para voltar a Rune.<br/>A <span class="npc-name">Kassandra</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> entrega <span class="quest-item">Caradine&#39;s Letter</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>; leve à <span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> em Goddard.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 36" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">36</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> e <span class="npc-name">Ossian</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Town of Goddard</span></span></label><p>Entregue <span class="quest-item">Caradine&#39;s Letter</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> à <span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.<br/>Ela manda ao <span class="npc-name">Ossian</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>, ao lado dela, que pede <span class="quest-item">Ring of Goddess</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> e <span class="quest-item">Necklace of Goddess</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.</p><p class="prereq">Parte 3 · requisito: subclasse nível 65 e Partes 1 e 2 concluídas.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 37" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">37</span><span><strong><span class="boss-name">Pilgrim of Shine</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span> e <span class="boss-name">Judge of Shine</span> <span class="badge-boss">monstro</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Centro do Valley of Saints</span></span></label><p>Colete <span class="quest-item">Ring of Goddess</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> (o anel demora) e <span class="quest-item">Necklace of Goddess</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>, depois leve ao <span class="npc-name">Ossian</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.<br/>Atenção: um guia chama esses monstros de Pilgrim of Splendor e Judge of Splendor.<br/>Confira o nome no quest log.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 38" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">38</span><span><strong><span class="boss-name">Flame of Shine Brakiel</span> <span class="badge-boss">RAID BOSS</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Raid (ver nota sobre o nome)</span></span></label><p>Mate o <span class="boss-name">Flame of Shine Brakiel</span> <span class="badge-boss">RAID BOSS</span> para obter <span class="quest-item">Staff of Goddess: Rain Song</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Leve grupo.<br/>O item vai para quem tem a quest, mesmo em grupo.<br/>Um guia escreve Barakiel.</p><div class="resp" data-boss="brakiel"><button type="button" class="resp-toggle">⏰ Informar respawn</button><div class="resp-panel"><span class="resp-label">Respawn no servidor (GMT+0)</span><div class="resp-fields"><div><span class="resp-sub">Dia</span><div class="seg"></div><input type="hidden" class="resp-dia" value="0"></div><label><span class="resp-sub">Hora</span><input type="time" class="resp-time" aria-label="Hora do respawn no servidor"></label></div><div class="resp-actions"><button type="button" class="resp-save">Salvar</button><button type="button" class="resp-clear">Limpar</button></div><div class="resp-err" role="status"></div></div><div class="resp-selo" role="status"></div></div></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 39" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">39</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Ossian</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> → <span class="npc-name">Magister Ladd</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Ivory Tower, 4º andar (Ladd)</span></span></label><p>Volte ao <span class="npc-name">Ossian</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> com o staff e receba <span class="quest-item">Relic Box</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Entregue ao <span class="npc-name">Magister Ladd</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> no 4º andar da Ivory Tower (opção inferior).<br/>Ele entrega <span class="quest-item">Caradine&#39;s Letter</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>.<br/>Fim da Parte 3.</p></article><article class="step" data-part="Nobless"><label><input aria-label="Concluir etapa 40" type="checkbox"/><span class="n">40</span><span><strong><span class="npc-name">Lady of Lake</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span></strong><span class="place">Localização: Perto da entrada do Coliseu</span></span></label><p>A <span class="npc-name">Caradine</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> teleporta você até a <span class="npc-name">Lady of Lake</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>.<br/>Fale com ela para receber o título de Noble e as skills de Noble.<br/>Quest concluída.</p><p class="prereq">Parte 4 · requisito: subclasse nível 75 e Partes 1 a 3 concluídas.</p></article></section><section class="panel hidden" id="manual"><h2>Manual do aventureiro</h2><p>Guia completo, em ordem, para personagem nível 75+. Marque cada etapa após conferir o <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> no inventário de quest. O progresso fica salvo neste navegador.</p><div class="legend"><span class="boss-name">● Boss — vermelho</span><span class="npc-name">● NPC — amarelo</span><span class="quest-item">● Item — verde</span></div><div class="notice green"><b>Nota sobre o servidor Eternal x10 (conferir na lista do NPC):</b> a <span class="npc-name">Maria</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> troca sua <span class="quest-item">Pipette Knife</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> pela <span class="quest-item">Red Pipette Knife</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> — não é necessário entrar no Baium. Também é possível adiar a entrega da arma Top B <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> e dos 984 <span class="quest-item">Crystal: B-Grade</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span>, recebendo um cupom <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> para resgatar a arma A <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> posteriormente com a <span class="npc-name">Maria</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span>. O <span class="quest-item">Pure Silver</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> também pode ser obtido trocando diretamente 100 <span class="quest-item">Moonstone Shard</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> com a <span class="npc-name">Maria</span> <span class="badge-npc">NPC</span> (método mais rápido e seguro).</div><div class="cols"><div class="box"><b>Fate's Whisper</b><br/>4 baús de raid<br/>3 Infernium Scepters <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>984 Crystal: B-Grade <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>1 arma Top B <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> ou cupom <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> adiado<br/>Recompensa: Star of Destiny <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span></div><div class="box"><b>Pure Silver</b><br/>100 Moonstone Shard <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span> (ou via Maria)<br/>10 Volcanic Ash <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>2 Quicksilver <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>1ª temperatura: Salamander</div><div class="box"><b>Mimir's Elixir</b><br/>1 Pure Silver <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>1 True Gold <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>1 Blood Fire <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>3ª temperatura: Phoenix</div></div></section><section class="panel hidden" id="resumo"><h2>Respawn dos bosses · ordem de respawn</h2><p class="small">Horários informados nas etapas de raid boss (servidor GMT+0), convertidos para Brasília. Ordenados pelo início da janela.</p><div id="sumlist"></div></section><section class="panel hidden" id="respawn"><h2>Calculadora de respawn · horário de Brasília</h2><div id="respawn-root"><div class="window"><header class="top"><div><i class="gem"></i> RAID BOSS INFORMATION</div><span class="close" aria-hidden="true">×</span></header><section class="content"><div class="crest">✦ LINEAGE II · INTERLUDE ✦</div><h1 class="heading">Respawn Calculator</h1><div class="sub">ETERNAL x10 · SERVIDOR GMT+0 / BRASÍLIA GMT-3</div><div class="ornament">◆ ─── ✧ ─── ◆</div><div class="fields"><div><label for="date">Data do respawn no servidor</label><input type="date" id="date" required></div><div><label for="time">Hora do respawn no servidor</label><input type="time" id="time" required></div></div><div class="error" id="error" role="status"></div><button class="button" id="calculate">CALCULAR RESPAWN</button><div class="separator"></div><div class="result" aria-live="polite"><small>JANELA DE RESPAWN · HORÁRIO DO BRASIL</small><div class="times"><div class="time"><span>INÍCIO</span><strong id="start">--:--</strong><em id="startDate">Informe os dados</em></div><div class="time"><span>LIMITE (+30 MIN)</span><strong id="end">--:--</strong><em id="endDate">Informe os dados</em></div></div><div class="note" id="description">O horário informado será convertido para Brasília, com margem de atraso de até 30 minutos.</div></div><button class="button" id="copy" type="button" disabled>COPIAR RESULTADO</button></section><footer class="footer"><span>DESENVOLVEDOR: Carlos Almeida (Anyelle) · <a href="mailto:carlosalmeida.pb@gmail.com">carlosalmeida.pb@gmail.com</a></span></footer></div></div></section><section class="panel hidden" id="inventory"><h2>Lista de itens e conferência</h2><div class="cols"><div class="box"><b>Fate's Whisper</b><br/>1 <span class="quest-item">Reiria's Soul Orb</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>1 <span class="quest-item">Hallate's Infernium Scepter</span> <span class="badge-item">ITEM</span><br/>1 <span class="quest-item">Kernon's Infernium Scepter</span> <span class="badg